  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"note\"><i><b>Note:</b> the star icon (★) denotes animated decorations.</i></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Seasonal decorations</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9b/Shop_Seasonal.png/revision/latest?cb=20171021182938\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Seasonal tab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Seasonal tab\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9b/Shop_Seasonal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/90?cb=20171021182938\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Seasonal tab</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Seasonal <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a> are found in the Seasonal tab. They are time-limited decorations, only available during or around certain holidays.  Prices reflect the cost to purchase the first decoration.  Subsequent purchases of the same decoration may cost more.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h4><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>New Year's</b></span></h4>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2d/Chicken_Balloon.png/revision/latest?cb=20150912161251\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken Balloon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2d/Chicken_Balloon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20150912161251\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/8d/Cow_Balloon.png/revision/latest?cb=20150912161258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><im